{"unit_id":"HTUP1__dsh-plugin-manager#card-zh","repo":"HTUP1/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"fb83228abd1943274c71d946bcf949b8300244d8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-manager 是适用于 DSH Web 的插件管理器，在设置面板提供插件列表。它通过宿主 RPC 读取当前 profile 的依赖和 bundles 注册状态，并可即时启用或停用插件、持久化开关状态；卸载时按安装方式调用 DSH CLI 或移除注册。界面显示版本、安装方式和状态提示，支持中文和英文。适合需要在 Web 设置中维护已安装插件的用户。需由宿主提供 loader、connection、slots、locale 服务；pnpm 插件完整卸载需要 dsh CLI。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:228","lib/index.js:145"]}
{"unit_id":"HTUP1__dsh-plugin-manager#card-en","repo":"HTUP1/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"fb83228abd1943274c71d946bcf949b8300244d8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-manager adds a Settings page to DSH Web for viewing installed plugins, versions, install types, and status. Users can toggle plugins live and save the choice to their profile, or uninstall via the DSH CLI or by removing registration. It supports Chinese and English.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:228","lib/index.js:145"]}
