{"unit_id":"HTUP1__dsh-plugin-manager#feature-1","repo":"HTUP1/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"fb83228abd1943274c71d946bcf949b8300244d8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"插件管理器的「插件列表」功能：读取当前 profile 的依赖和 bundles 注册，显示插件名称、版本、安装方式、启用状态及可用描述。打开设置中的插件管理页自动加载列表，也可手动刷新。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:147","lib/client.js:114"]}
{"unit_id":"HTUP1__dsh-plugin-manager#feature-2","repo":"HTUP1/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"fb83228abd1943274c71d946bcf949b8300244d8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"插件管理器的「启用与停用」功能：在列表行点击启用或停用，通过 loader 即时切换当前挂载，并更新 profile 的 bundles 列表以保存状态。界面会提示是否已即时生效或需重启。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:123","lib/index.js:178","lib/client.js:33"]}
{"unit_id":"HTUP1__dsh-plugin-manager#feature-3","repo":"HTUP1/dsh-plugin-manager","commit":"fb83228abd1943274c71d946bcf949b8300244d8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"插件管理器的「卸载插件」功能：在列表行发起卸载并二次确认；pnpm 安装的插件交由 dsh CLI 移除，手动安装的插件则移除 profile 注册并停用。CLI 未成功时改为移除注册，保留包文件并显示结果提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:194","lib/index.js:198"]}
